== routes focus: input#fd-v-49-title ""
{
 "heading": "New route",
 "name": "New route",
 "text": "New route It starts as a draft without stops; add them in the editor, then activate it. Title · English(required) Setting(required) Indoor routes put their stops on floor plans; outdoor routes are drawn on a map. Choose where the route runs Indoor: Inside a building. Stops sit on floor plans Outdoor: On a site or in a city. Drawn on a map Slug: built from the title Edit slug Cancel Create and open",
